// fx.ns — 环境特效进程：根据飞行场景进程送来的机体状态与尾迹，计算下洗尘土、故障冒烟、撞击火花、
// 火焰与浓烟的发射参数，再交给播放器一并提交。显示设备按提交的参数和时刻展开粒子，不推进任何状态。
let A = args();
let PLAYER = A.player;
fn clampf(v, lo, hi) { return v < lo ? lo : (v > hi ? hi : v); }
fn make_fx(fl) {
  let emit = []; let simt = fl.simt;
  let wash = nil;
  let tr = fl.trail;
  let n = len(tr);
  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {
    let s = tr[i];            // [t, x, y, z, agl, om, c]
    let agl = s[4]; let om = s[5];
    if (agl < 20 && om > 0.55 && !(fl.crash != nil && s[0] >= fl.crash.t)) {
      let k = clampf(1 - agl / 20, 0, 1) * om;
      if (k > 0.1) {
        push(emit, {k: "dust", p: [s[1], s[2] - agl - 1.35 + 0.1, s[3]], t0: s[0], t1: s[0] + 0.1, rate: 60 * k, life: 1.7, r: 2.5 + 6 * k, up: 1.1, size: 1.5, grow: 1.6, color: "#b9a37a", alpha: 0.30 * k + 0.08, seed: i + 3});
      }
    }
    if (fl.smoke_t != nil && fl.smoke_t >= 0 && s[0] >= fl.smoke_t && !(fl.crash != nil && s[0] >= fl.crash.t)) {
      push(emit, {k: "smoke", p: [s[1], s[2] + 0.3, s[3]], t0: s[0], t1: s[0] + 0.1, rate: 90, life: 2.6, up: 1.2, spread: 0.8, size: 0.9, grow: 2.4, color: "#2b2830", alpha: 0.55, seed: i + 41});
    }
  }
  if (n > 0) {
    let last = tr[n - 1];
    if (last[4] < 18 && last[5] > 0.3 && !fl.crash) { wash = {p: [last[1], last[3]], r: 15, s: clampf(1 - last[4] / 18, 0, 1) * last[5]}; }
  }
  if (fl.crash != nil) {
    let c = fl.crash; let gy = c.y;
    push(emit, {k: "spark", p: [c.x, gy + 0.6, c.z], t0: c.t, t1: c.t + 0.5, rate: 160, life: 1.1, up: 4.2, spread: 2.2, size: 0.28, grow: 0, color: "#ffd25a", alpha: 1, seed: 5});
    if (c.speed > 5.5) {
      push(emit, {k: "fire", p: [c.x, gy + 0.5, c.z], t0: c.t + 0.3, t1: c.t + 7, rate: 55, life: 1.15, up: 2.8, spread: 1.4, size: 1.5, grow: 1.1, alpha: 0.85, seed: 9});
      push(emit, {k: "fire", p: [c.x + 1.3, gy + 0.4, c.z - 0.8], t0: c.t + 0.6, t1: c.t + 6, rate: 30, life: 0.95, up: 2.2, spread: 1, size: 1.1, grow: 1, alpha: 0.8, seed: 19});
    }
    push(emit, {k: "smoke", p: [c.x, gy + 0.8, c.z], t0: c.t + 0.1, t1: c.t + 60, rate: 26, life: 6.5, up: 2.6, spread: 1.6, size: 2.3, grow: 3.2, color: "#1c1a20", alpha: 0.62, seed: 13});
    push(emit, {k: "dust", p: [c.x, gy + 0.1, c.z], t0: c.t, t1: c.t + 0.45, rate: 110, life: 3, r: 7, up: 2.2, size: 3, grow: 2.2, color: "#a99572", alpha: 0.5, seed: 23});
  }
  return {t: "fx", simt: simt, emit: emit, wash: wash};
}
while (true) {
  let e = recv();
  let m = e.msg;
  if (typeof(m) == "map" && m.t == "fl") {
    // 只处理最新的一帧（积压时跳过旧帧；已收到的消息不丢，只是不重复计算）
    let nx = poll_msg();
    while (nx != nil) { if (typeof(nx.msg) == "map" && nx.msg.t == "fl") { m = nx.msg; } nx = poll_msg(); }
    send(PLAYER, make_fx(m));
  }
}
